      "premise": "\"The sky is always transparently beautiful\"—repeating these words to myself, I walk through the fog. In my hands are the \"secret map\" left behind by my daughter and a \"broken sword\" I once believed was worth protecting. I believe that if I reach the place pointed to by the map, the peace I thought I lost will return. Yet, the shadow of \"something\" creeping up from behind slowly and surely erodes my perception of reality."
